5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I need to know how much time the move actually steals from our mornings.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to understand the actual monthly cost of this floor before we rearrange anything.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I want to ensure the seating hierarchy is explicit, not just assumed by whoever grabs the best spot first.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I need to verify the acoustic and ergonomic reality of each spot, not just the drawn lines.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I want to see how our seating actually shapes who we talk to, so we can choose it on purpose, not by accident.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if the floor billing is high, does that mean we have to rush the move?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, not necessarily. The billing is fixed regardless of layout. I just need to know the baseline before we spend more.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, your acoustic check is vital. I want to know if the ""quiet"" spots are actually just isolated, which would hurt our team cohesion.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, isolation is a feature, not a bug. I need to know if the sound levels actually support deep work, not just social convenience.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, I agree! But if we isolate people, we lose those casual chats. I want us to pick seats that keep us connected, not just comfortable.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Yumi, I worry that ""connected"" means constant noise. I need to protect my short gaps between meetings.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, I understand. But the budget is static. We cannot afford to waste time on inefficient layouts.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, I hear you. But if we hide in corners, we lose the chance to fix the unfairness I see. We need balance.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, your gaps are valid, but comfort is non-negotiable for me. I will prioritize spots that support my body and silence.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Rin, I get it! But maybe we can find a middle ground? I want us to talk, but not at the cost of your peace.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, I will check the morning routine upstairs and the badge arrival times to see exactly how much time we lose.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, I will check the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, I will check the drawn plan against the staff survey and the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, I will check the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, I will check what this year's two joiners reported and the two project strands within earshot last spring.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
