35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"- **Rin**: @Toshio, the pilot floor takes up to nine minutes just to set up. That is huge for my short gaps.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, nine minutes is painful, but the real cost is structural. We are billed for area, not people. Those two empty desks cost us 41,000 yen monthly.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, that waste is unacceptable. But my data shows the window seats are the real prize. We must assign them deliberately, not by luck.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, luck is not a strategy. The printer row is nine decibels louder. I need a spot where my body can settle without constant correction.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, nine decibels is a lot! But I found that when projects sat close, answers came in seconds. I want us to sit where we can actually help each other quickly.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Yumi, seconds are great, but I need silence. If we sit close, I lose my focus. I need a buffer zone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, silence is a luxury. The facilities quote is 6,200 yen per desk for re-running power. Every change we make now is a direct hit to that static budget.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, I see the cost. But my survey data shows daylight is the top complaint. We must assign windows fairly, not let them drift again.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, six thousand yen is trivial if it buys me a stable, quiet spot. I will not trade my comfort for your budget anxiety.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Toshio, I hear you on the budget! But if we sit close, the new joiners learn faster. I want us to be a team, not just five separate desks.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, I need a buffer zone to protect my focus. Can we place me away from the loud printer row?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, a buffer zone is free if we do not move the power. Moving desks costs 6,200 yen each. I will not pay for your silence.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, I agree with your need for space. But we must also address the window disparity. I propose a rotation system to ensure fairness.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, rotation is chaos. My body needs days to settle into a setting. I will not reset my posture every week for your fairness metric.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, I get that your body needs stability! But maybe we can find a quiet spot that is also close enough for quick chats?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, rotation sounds exhausting. I just want a fixed spot away from the noise so I can actually work in my short gaps.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, rotation is a false economy. Every swap triggers the 6,200 yen fee. We must lock the layout to stop the bleeding.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, I hear the budget concern. But the shuffles cost us two weeks of productivity. A stable, fair layout prevents that hidden drain.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, I will not rotate. My body needs stability to settle. I need a fixed, quiet spot where I can work without constant physical correction.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, I agree! Stability is key. Let's find a fixed layout that keeps us close enough to chat, but respects Shion's need for quiet.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
